  "name": "Per-Collection Embedding Model",
  "description": "Operators assign an embedding model per collection at creation or via a new PATCH endpoint. A lazy-load LRU embedder cache serves ingest and search; an explicit reindex lifecycle promotes pending models. Adds an MCP tool, CLI fix and status surfacing.",
